/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 245 0 R
/T (The Arduino Uno is a highly celebrated open-source microcontroller board, renowned for its adaptability, user-friendliness, and robust community support. Originating in Italy in 2005 at the Interaction Design Institute Ivrea \(IDII\), Arduino was created as a tool to enable students to craft interactive projects. Its inception aimed to democratize electronics and programming, making them accessible to artists, designers, hobbyists, and enthusiasts, thereby fostering creative innovation. )
/E (The Arduino Uno is a highly celebrated open-source microcontroller board, renowned for its adaptability, user-friendliness, and robust community support. Originating in Italy in 2005 at the Interaction Design Institute Ivrea \(IDII\), Arduino was created as a tool to enable students to craft interactive projects. Its inception aimed to democratize electronics and programming, making them accessible to artists, designers, hobbyists, and enthusiasts, thereby fostering creative innovation. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
