/T (LEDs are popular not only for their efficiencyand long life but also for their versatility. They can be found in various sizes and shapes, from tiny surface-mount devices to high-power LEDs used for lighting applications. There are also multi-color or RGB LEDs, which contain three separate diodes \(red, green, and blue\) in a single package. By adjusting the brightness of each internal diode, we can mix and create virtually any color of the rainbow. This versatility, combined with their reliability, makes the LED a go-to component for adding visual flair and functionality to any electronic project.)
