/Title (The future scope of our air quality monitoring system developed with Arduino, there are many avenues for expansion and refinement. Our project, which is a great starting point, can be transformed into a more comprehensive and powerful tool. We can make it smarter, more connected, and more sustainable for long-term use in the community.)
/Dest [41 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 789 0 R
/Next 1405 0 R
>>
endobj
1233 0 obj
<<
/Title (In conclusion, the future of our air quality monitoring system is rich with opportunities for innovation and integration with new technologies. By embracing advancements in data analytics, wireless connectivity, and sustainable hardware design, we can evolve the system into a versatile and intelligent solution for protecting our community. These upgrades will help us to not only measure pollution, but also to truly empower people with the knowledge they need to build a healthier and safer environment for everyone.)
/Dest [41 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 789 0 R
/Prev 1406 0 R
>>
endobj
