1827 0 obj
<<
/Title (The primary purpose of our air quality monitoring project is to address a critical gap in environmental awareness at the community level. While air pollution is a well-documented global issue, the data about it often remains inaccessible and disconnected from the everyday lives of residents in local neighbourhoods. A community survey conducted in Muralinagar, Visakhapatnam, confirmed this problem, highlighting a pressing need for a simple and affordable tool that could provide real-time information about the air people breathe. Our project was conceived to fill this need by providing a tangible, hands-on solution. By leveraging readily available components like the Arduino Uno microcontroller and the MQ- 135 gas sensor, our system transforms complex environmental data into a clear and understandable format displayed on an LCD screen. The core purpose is to empower individuals with knowledge, turning an invisible threat into a visible, manageable concern and enabling them to make informed decisions for their health.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1817 0 R
/Next 1828 0 R
>>
endobj
