<<
/Title (The 16x2 Liquid Crystal Display \(LCD\) is a common and versatile display module used in countless electronic projects, including our air quality monitoring system. As its name suggests, it is a display that can show up to 16 characters per line across two lines. This simple display is perfect for displaying short, clear messages and is ideal for projects that need to present real-time data to a user without requiring a complex graphical interface. Its low power consumption and straightforward operation make it a popular choice for hobbyists and engineers alike.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1866 0 R
/Next 1877 0 R
>>
endobj
